Subject: [PATCH 8/9] NTimeDiagonalizer: factor two in-file copies
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The after screen found two in-file copies: `qy_hosted` against `qy_hosted'` (97–100%) and
`qy_embed`, `qy_embed_state` against `qy_embed_gen` (91–99%). `qy_hosted` is now `qy_hosted'`
with its avoided set checked once for all, and `qy_embed_gen` comes first, with `qy_embed` and
`qy_embed_state` read through it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PqpVTj5speLTvae6QLXuLG
